SUMMARY:NO TRADE | USD Federal Funds Rate\, FOMC Statement
DESCRIPTION:CATEGORY 1 - DO NOT TRADE\n\nRelease: 2:00 PM ET\nCancel bracke
 t orders. Be 100% flat in NQ\, ES and ZN by 1:50 PM ET.\nDo not trade agai
 n until 2:10 PM ET.\n\nFederal Funds Rate\nWHAT IT IS: The Fed's interest 
 rate decision and statement (quarterly meetings also include the dot plot)
 .\nWHY IT MATTERS: The biggest scheduled event of the cycle. It sets rate 
 expectations for everything\, so ZN\, NQ and ES all move hard.\nForecast 4
 .00%\, Previous 4.00%\n\nFOMC Statement\nWHAT IT IS: The Fed's interest ra
 te decision and statement (quarterly meetings also include the dot plot).\
 nWHY IT MATTERS: The biggest scheduled event of the cycle. It sets rate ex
 pectations for everything\, so ZN\, NQ and ES all move hard.\n\nMoves: ZN\
 , NQ\, ES
