BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fx-US-20261029T083000-1@fxcalendar
DTSTAMP:20261025T104556Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261029T082000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261029T084000
SUMMARY:NO TRADE | USD Advance GDP q/q\, Core PCE Price Index m/m
DESCRIPTION:CATEGORY 1 - DO NOT TRADE\n\nRelease: 8:30 AM ET\nCancel bracke
 t orders. Be 100% flat in NQ\, ES and ZN by 8:20 AM ET.\nDo not trade agai
 n until 8:40 AM ET.\n\nAdvance GDP q/q\nWHAT IT IS: A GDP estimate (econom
 ic growth). The advance estimate matters most\; later ones are revisions.\
 nWHY IT MATTERS: Shows if growth is strong or weak\, which feeds rate expe
 ctations.\nForecast 3.2%\, Previous 1.5%\n\nCore PCE Price Index m/m\nWHAT
  IT IS: PCE inflation\, the Fed's preferred inflation gauge.\nWHY IT MATTE
 RS: Hotter than forecast = yields up (ZN down)\, NQ pressured. Cooler = th
 e reverse.\nForecast 0.3%\, Previous 0.2%\n\nMoves: ES\, NQ\, ZN
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:NO TRADE | USD Advance GDP q/q\, Core PCE Price Index m/m
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
