SUMMARY:CAUTION | EUR Main Refinancing Rate\, Monetary Policy Statement
DESCRIPTION:CATEGORY 2 - PROCEED WITH CAUTION\n\nRelease: 9:15 AM ET\nBe fl
 at from 9:10 AM ET to 9:30 AM ET\, then trade smaller until the move settl
 es.\n\nMain Refinancing Rate\nWHAT IT IS: The ECB's interest rate decision
  and statement.\nWHY IT MATTERS: Moves European yields\, which spill into 
 ZN and ES. Matches your 8:10 to 8:30 rule for an 8:15 release.\nForecast 2
 .65%\, Previous 2.65%\n\nMonetary Policy Statement\nWHAT IT IS: The ECB's 
 interest rate decision and statement.\nWHY IT MATTERS: Moves European yiel
 ds\, which spill into ZN and ES. Matches your 8:10 to 8:30 rule for an 8:1
 5 release.\n\nMoves: ZN\, ES
